  <item>
    <title>为了治愈Arcane S2带来的创伤，我给S1编剧写了邮件【双城之战主创Q&amp;A】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6790788cc3617f02a46bd3e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6790788cc3617f02a46bd3e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jan 2025 04:52:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Arcane受害者协会是一档对由拳头游戏出品、fortiche制作的奈飞剧集《英雄联盟：双城之战》的影评杂谈节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>*就Arcane S2让人产生的疑惑之处写了一封长邮件发给了S1的核心编剧Ash Brannon。Ash回复了我的邮件，主要回答了我的两个疑问：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.第一季是如何构思和写作的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.S1-S2的编剧团队变动带来了什么影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span>*谁是Ash Brannon?</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ash是双城之战第一季的co-producer和核心编剧之一，第一季评分最高也是目前全系列评分最高的S1E3就是written by &amp; story by him。除此之外，他还是《玩具总动员1》的动画导演、《玩具总动员2》的联合导演和编剧，获得过艾美奖、安妮奖，还拿到过奥斯卡提名。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐版权信息：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《What Could Have Been feat. Ray Chen (from the series Arcane League of Legends)》--Sting / &nbsp;Ray Chen</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6687bb490bc5d7cc700e0f61/lu3lqk47hK2r-45I0873AqyW89At.m4a" length="22596148" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:18:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTpHQOTmd3EFAGWUEiYMCn8fAfw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
